label pi-secondary-font\">Achievement</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Warlock (Achievement)</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.8<br/>August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See Also: Outfits, Outfiter <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-outfit-images\" style=\"font-size:small;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Images\">Images</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Outfit</th>\n<th>Addon 1</th>\n<th>Addon 2</th>\n<th>Addons 1+2\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Male\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Wizard Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Wizard_Male_8a4569.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Wizard Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Wizard_Male_Addon_1_11368b.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Wizard Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Wizard_Male_Addon_2_810c5d.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Wizard Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Wizard_Male_Addon_3_fa41ed.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Female\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Wizard Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Wizard_Female_1be5a8.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Wizard Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Wizard_Female_Addon_1_7d8e4c.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Wizard Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Wizard_Female_Addon_2_42e2f6.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Wizard Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Wizard_Female_Addon_3_81d13f.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-outfit-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Are you feeling evil today? This outfit is fitting for mages pursuing the dark side of sorcery. Shunned by the magic academy of Edron, you might find wizards hiding near Thais.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Outfits\">Related Outfits</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Premium_Outfits\">Premium Outfits</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Barbarian Outfits</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid%20Outfits\">Druid Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nobleman%20Outfits\">Nobleman Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Oriental%20Outfits\">Oriental Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Summoner%20Outfits\">Summoner Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/